@guide A_Westfall
@name Westfall
@faction Alliance
@levels 10-16
@zone Westfall
@chapter Azeroth
@desc Farms of northern Westfall, Sentinel Hill and the Jangolode Mine, then the coast and the Defias chain up to Moonbrook. Leaves for Redridge at about 15-16.
@next A_Redridge

accept 184 Furlbrow's Deed [race=Dwarf,Night Elf,Gnome,Draenei; optional]
accept 1097 Elmore's Task [race=Dwarf,Night Elf,Gnome,Draenei]
accept 1685 Gakin's Summons [class=Warlock; race=Gnome; optional]
accept 5635 Desperate Prayer [class=Priest; race=Dwarf; optional]
accept 1638 A Warrior's Training [class=Warrior; race=Dwarf,Night Elf,Gnome,Draenei; optional]
accept 123 The Collector [race=Dwarf,Night Elf,Gnome,Draenei; optional]
turnin 123 The Collector [class=Warrior,Rogue,Mage; race=Gnome; optional]
turnin 123 The Collector [race=Dwarf,Night Elf,Draenei; optional]
turnin 184 Furlbrow's Deed [race=Dwarf,Night Elf,Gnome,Draenei; optional]
accept Westfall Stew | Verna Furlbrow waits by the wagon at the Furlbrow farm, just over the Elwynn border.
accept Poor Old Blanchy
accept The Forgotten Heirloom
turnin 36 Westfall Stew | Salma Saldean, Saldean's Farm.
accept 38 Westfall Stew
accept Goretusk Liver Pie
accept The Killing Fields
turnin Report to Gryan Stoutmantle [mark=star] | Sentinel Hill tower.
accept 6181 A Swift Message [race=Human; optional]
turnin 6181 A Swift Message [race=Human; optional]
accept 6281 Continue to Stormwind [race=Human]
turnin 61 Shipment to Stormwind [race=Human]
turnin 1685 Gakin's Summons [class=Warlock; race=Human,Gnome; optional]
turnin 123 The Collector [class=Warlock; race=Gnome; optional]
turnin 6281 Continue to Stormwind [race=Human]
turnin 1638 A Warrior's Training [class=Warrior; optional]
accept 1639 Bartleby the Drunk [class=Warrior]
turnin 1639 Bartleby the Drunk [class=Warrior]
accept 1665 Bartleby's Mug [class=Warrior; race=Dwarf,Night Elf,Gnome,Draenei]
turnin 1665 Bartleby's Mug [class=Warrior; race=Dwarf,Night Elf,Gnome,Draenei]
turnin 5635 Desperate Prayer [class=Priest; race=Human,Dwarf; optional]
accept 12 The People's Militia
accept Patrolling Westfall
accept Red Leather Bandanas
fp Sentinel Hill
complete The Killing Fields | Harvest Watchers in the fields around Saldean's and the Molsen farm.
complete Poor Old Blanchy | Oat sacks lie in the fields; take them back to Verna.
complete Goretusk Liver Pie | Goretusks everywhere in the north.
complete 38 Westfall Stew | Murlocs on the coast drop Murloc Eyes; Goretusks give snouts; vultures give Stringy Vulture Meat. Okra comes from the field crates.
complete The Forgotten Heirloom | The pocket watch is in a box in the Alexston farmstead barn.
turnin Poor Old Blanchy
turnin The Forgotten Heirloom
turnin The Killing Fields
turnin Goretusk Liver Pie
turnin 38 Westfall Stew
complete 12 The People's Militia | Defias Trappers and Smugglers north of Jangolode Mine.
complete Patrolling Westfall | Gnolls south of Sentinel Hill.
complete Red Leather Bandanas | Any Defias in Westfall drops them.
turnin 12 The People's Militia
accept 13 The People's Militia
turnin Patrolling Westfall
turnin Red Leather Bandanas
complete 13 The People's Militia | Defias Pathstalkers and Highwaymen west of the Jangolode Mine.
turnin 13 The People's Militia
accept 14 The People's Militia
accept 65 The Defias Brotherhood | Leads to Lakeshire (Redridge); you will hand it in there.
accept Keeper of the Flame | Captain Grayson at the Westfall Lighthouse.
accept The Coast Isn't Clear
complete Keeper of the Flame | Kill Gnoll Mystics on the coast for Flasks of Oil.
complete The Coast Isn't Clear | Murlocs along the shore north of the lighthouse.
turnin Keeper of the Flame
turnin The Coast Isn't Clear
accept The Coastal Menace [elite; group=2; optional] | Old Murk-Eye (elite murloc). Skip if solo below level 16.
complete 14 The People's Militia | Defias Looters and Pillagers around the Moonbrook area.
turnin 14 The People's Militia
complete The Coastal Menace [elite; group=2; optional]
turnin The Coastal Menace [optional]
level 15 | Grind Defias around Moonbrook if needed.
train | Train in Stormwind or Goldshire before leaving.
note The Deadmines (dungeon, 17-21) starts in Moonbrook. Most of its quests come later with the Defias Brotherhood chain.
fly Lakeshire | Walk from Elwynn's east road into Redridge, or fly if you already have the Lakeshire flight path.
